{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Marisa  $Saki  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Marisa Kirisame",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the unchanging goddess."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness how Gensokyo changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Forest of Magic."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >That Incident Stone was real, after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Thanks to you, I can take some time off of work. Thank you."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Hey, wait! Turn Gensokyo back to normal first!"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >It's alright. If I release my power, Gensokyo should go back to normal."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >What? What do you mean \"Depends on me\"..?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In the dense forest, all sorts of demons lurk."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >I found it!"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Guh, you're from the Animal Realm..."
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >I'm Saki, from the Keiga Group! I'm the boss! Bow down!"
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >Don't be so heartless."
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Why are you in a place like this?"
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My subordinates told me that a Magician on the surface",
                "had an aura similar to my own."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Ah, could it be this Incident Stone?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >That's it. It definitely seems like my own power."
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >Man, I'm so happy.",
                "<l$> You've finally made up your mind, huh?"
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Huuh?"
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >You must have been drawn to our Keiga Group, right?",
                "<l$> You're always welcome to join. I'll even make you an executive."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Hold on, I have no plans to become a Yakuza."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But this Incident Stone definitely helped."
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you make it?"
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >Hmm, I don't remember...",
                "<l$> But if it has my power, I probably did."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Saki  >Yes, I made it. Definitely."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you become my subordinate, I'll make you as many as you want."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >No way."
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You couldn't have made such an intricate Incident Stone (Magic Item)."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This Incident Stone is clearly not from the muscle-headed Keiga Group."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However, it's true that the Keiga Group's power helped resolve the incident."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "As Gensokyo starts to resist change, a stone with the power of a strange,",
                "change-loving incident appears before Marisa."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It would be impossible to dismiss it as a coincidence."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To get to the bottom of this, maybe it would be good ",
                "to cooperate with the Keiga Group for a bit."
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's what Marisa thought."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ending No. 10: Incidents are Firepower too!"
            ]
        }
    }
}